%description:
A background cell is on a carrier the radio medium has a model for: a CQI of the cell is a
what-if on the medium, evaluated by the medium's channel model on the cell's carrier. A cell on
3.5 GHz with the medium's only carrier on 2 GHz is an error when its background UE's first CQI
is computed, at t=0. bgScheduler.carrierFrequency has a default, 2 GHz, so this also is what a
network on 3.5 GHz gets for not setting it.

The what-if is the path that rejects this, so this configuration takes it: the default of a
periodic CQI update, and a background UE with traffic in DL, as a generator without traffic
computes no CQI. With useProbabilisticCqi = true there is no what-if, and the same cell stops
later, at its first allocation, on an error of the Binder that does not name the medium.

The receiver's node id in the message is the background UE's, which this test does not pin.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: harness.ned
import simu5g.common.binder.Binder;
import simu5g.common.carrierAggregation.CarrierAggregation;
import simu5g.nodes.BackgroundCell;
import simu5g.stack.phy.medium.CellularRadioMedium;

network BackgroundCellRejectedTestNetwork
{
    submodules:
        binder: Binder;
        radioMedium: CellularRadioMedium;
        carrierAggregation: CarrierAggregation;
        bgCell: BackgroundCell;
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = BackgroundCellRejectedTestNetwork

*.carrierAggregation.numComponentCarriers = 1
*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0].carrierFrequency = 2GHz
*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0].numBands = 6
*.bgCell.bgScheduler.isNr = true
*.bgCell.bgScheduler.carrierFrequency = 3.5GHz
*.bgCell.bgScheduler.numBands = 6
*.bgCell.bgTrafficGenerator.numBgUes = 1
*.bgCell.bgTrafficGenerator.bgUE[0].generator.startTimeDl = 0.1s
*.bgCell.mobility.initialX = 250m
*.bgCell.mobility.initialY = 500m
*.bgCell.bgTrafficGenerator.bgUE[0].mobility.initialX = 500m
*.bgCell.bgTrafficGenerator.bgUE[0].mobility.initialY = 400m

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
of a what-if does not operate on its carrier 3.5 GHz
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
